     by its authors) and the images in Support/Media/ that come from other works, which
     belong to their respective authors.
   - The community plugins in .obsidian/plugins/ (other than texere) and the themes in
     .obsidian/themes/, distributed under their own licenses by their authors.
   - The third-party code bundled in .obsidian/plugins/texere/main.js: citeproc-js
